    <date>
    
        July 18, 2026
    
    </date>

<h1 class="subject">AI Industry Daily — Saturday, July 18, 2026</h1>


                


<div class="email-body-content ">
    
        <p class="empty-line" style="height:16px; margin:0px !important;"></p>
<!DOCTYPE html>

<p><html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/>
<meta content="light only" name="color-scheme"/>
<meta content="light" name="supported-color-schemes"/>
<title>AI Industry Daily</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" rel="preconnect"/>
<link crossorigin="" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" rel="preconnect"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;800;900&amp;family=Source+Serif+4:wght@400;600&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;800;900&family=Source+Serif+4:wght@400;600&display=swap');
  body { margin:0; padding:0; background:#f5f1ea; }
  a { color:#1a1714; }
  @media (max-width:620px) {
    .px { padding-left:20px !important; padding-right:20px !important; }
    .masthead-title { font-size:30px !important; }
    .top-headline { font-size:24px !important; }
  }
</style></head></html></p>
<p>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f1ea;color:#1a1714;">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;color:#f5f1ea;">
  Saturday, July 18, 2026 · Meta and Anthropic discuss $10 billion compute leasing deal
</div>
<table bgcolor="#f5f1ea" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="background:#f5f1ea;" width="100%">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#f5f1ea;" width="600">
<!-- Date stamp -->
<tr><td align="center" class="px" style="padding:0 32px 16px 32px;">
<p style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;margin:0;line-height:1.4;">Saturday, July 18, 2026</p>
</td></tr>
<!-- Masthead -->
<tr><td align="center" class="px" style="padding:0 32px 6px 32px;">
<img alt="" height="40" src="https://ai-newsletter-eta-lemon.vercel.app/icons/icon-192.png" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:40px;height:40px;margin:0 auto 10px auto;" width="40"/>
<h1 class="masthead-title" style="font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:38px;font-weight:900;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#1a1714;margin:0;">
          AI Industry Daily
        </h1>
</td></tr>
<!-- Strong rule under masthead -->
<tr><td class="px" style="padding:22px 32px 0 32px;">
<div style="border-top:2px solid #1a1714;line-height:0;font-size:0;"> </div>
<div style="border-top:1px solid #1a1714;margin-top:3px;line-height:0;font-size:0;"> </div>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:30px 0 0 0;"> </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 32px;">
<p style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;margin:0;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 12px 0;">Today’s top story</p>
<p style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;margin:0;line-height:1.4;color:#1a1714;margin:0 0 14px 0;">INDUSTRY</p>
<h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#1a1714;margin:0 0 14px 0;text-wrap:pretty;">
    Meta and Anthropic discuss $10 billion compute leasing deal
  </h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px 0;">
<a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-07-17/meta-in-talks-to-sell-computing-power-to-anthropic-nyt-reports?utm_source=aiindustrydaily&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-industry-daily-saturday-july-18-2026" style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#C85520;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:2px;">Bloomberg</a>
</p>
<p style="font-family:'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a4540;margin:0 0 22px 0;">
    Meta Platforms is in early talks to lease Anthropic up to $10 billion in computing power over two years, a deal Anthropic proposed to Meta in June. The negotiations are still nascent, with monthly payments and an exit option for either side under discussion.
  </p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 32px 36px 32px;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="border-collapse:collapse;" width="100%">
<tr>
<td style="border-left:3px solid #C85520;padding:2px 0 2px 16px;">
<p style="font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1a1714;margin:0;line-height:1.4;color:#C85520;margin:0 0 6px 0;">Why it matters</p>
<p style="font-family:'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#1a1714;margin:0;">
          The talks would turn Meta, a direct AI competitor, into a compute supplier for Anthropic, showing how scarce GPU capacity is reshaping alliances even between rival labs as Anthropic prepares for a possible fall IPO.
        </p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 32px 0 32px;border-top:2px solid #1a1714;">
<p style="font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1a1714;margin:0;line-height:1.4;padding:18px 0 16px 0;margin:0;">More headlines</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:20px 32px 22px 32px;">
<p style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;margin:0;line-height:1.4;color:#8a8078;margin:0 0 10px 0;">FUNDING</p>
<h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#1a1714;margin:0 0 8px 0;text-wrap:pretty;">
    Fireworks AI raises $1.5 billion Series D at $17.5 billion valuation
  </h3>
<p style="font-family:'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4540;margin:0 0 12px 0;">
    The inference infrastructure startup's round was led by Atreides Management, Index Ventures, and TCV, with Nvidia among the participants. Fireworks says it now serves more than 40 trillion tokens daily and has surpassed $1 billion in annualized revenue.
  </p>
<p style="margin:0;">
<a href="https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260716264405/en/Fireworks-Raises-a-$1.5-Billion-Series-D-to-Lead-the-Specialized-Intelligence-Revolution?utm_source=aiindustrydaily&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-industry-daily-saturday-july-18-2026" style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#C85520;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:2px;">Business Wire</a>
</p>
</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:20px 32px 22px 32px;border-top:1px solid #ddd6c8;">
<p style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;margin:0;line-height:1.4;color:#8a8078;margin:0 0 10px 0;">INDUSTRY</p>
<h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#1a1714;margin:0 0 8px 0;text-wrap:pretty;">
    Microsoft preps AI security tool to undercut Anthropic's Mythos
  </h3>
<p style="font-family:'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4540;margin:0 0 12px 0;">
    Microsoft is readying a vulnerability-detection product code-named Project Perception that routes tasks across Microsoft, OpenAI, and Anthropic models to lower costs relative to Anthropic's Mythos. Pricing, supported workloads, and a launch date have not been made public.
  </p>
<p style="margin:0;">
<a href="https://www.techrepublic.com/article/news-microsoft-project-perception-ai-security-tool/?utm_source=aiindustrydaily&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-industry-daily-saturday-july-18-2026" style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#C85520;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:2px;">TechRepublic</a>
</p>
</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:20px 32px 22px 32px;border-top:1px solid #ddd6c8;">
<p style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;margin:0;line-height:1.4;color:#8a8078;margin:0 0 10px 0;">INDUSTRY</p>
<h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#1a1714;margin:0 0 8px 0;text-wrap:pretty;">
    TSMC posts record profit as AI chip demand fuels growth
  </h3>
<p style="font-family:'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4540;margin:0 0 12px 0;">
    TSMC's second-quarter net profit rose 77% year over year to a record as AI chips drove 66% of high-performance-computing revenue. The company raised its full-year revenue growth outlook above 40% and pledged another $100 billion toward its Arizona expansion.
  </p>
<p style="margin:0;">
<a href="https://www.techtimes.com/articles/320696/20260716/tsmc-posts-record-quarter-ai-chip-demand-pushes-full-year-growth-outlook-past-40.htm?utm_source=aiindustrydaily&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-industry-daily-saturday-july-18-2026" style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#C85520;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:2px;">Tech Times</a>
</p>
</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:20px 32px 22px 32px;border-top:1px solid #ddd6c8;">
<p style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;margin:0;line-height:1.4;color:#8a8078;margin:0 0 10px 0;">RELEASE</p>
<h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#1a1714;margin:0 0 8px 0;text-wrap:pretty;">
    Huawei shows off Atlas 950 SuperPoD, its largest AI cluster
  </h3>
<p style="font-family:'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4540;margin:0 0 12px 0;">
    Huawei displayed the physical Atlas 950 SuperPoD at the World AI Conference in Shanghai, linking thousands of Ascend chips into a single supernode the company says outperforms Nvidia's NVL144 on raw compute. The system runs entirely on domestic hardware.
  </p>
<p style="margin:0;">
<a href="https://www.scmp.com/tech/article/3359733/huaweis-new-computing-cluster-worlds-first-ai-agent-phone-debut-china-ai-summit?utm_source=aiindustrydaily&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-industry-daily-saturday-july-18-2026" style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#C85520;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:2px;">South China Morning Post</a>
</p>
</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:20px 32px 22px 32px;border-top:1px solid #ddd6c8;">
<p style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;margin:0;line-height:1.4;color:#8a8078;margin:0 0 10px 0;">RELEASE</p>
<h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#1a1714;margin:0 0 8px 0;text-wrap:pretty;">
    Google delays broader Gemini 3.5 Pro rollout on coding gaps
  </h3>
<p style="font-family:'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4540;margin:0 0 12px 0;">
    Google has pushed back the wider release of Gemini 3.5 Pro after internal testing found shortfalls in coding performance and complex reasoning, keeping the model in limited enterprise preview on Vertex AI. It is the model's third delay since being previewed at I/O in May.
  </p>
<p style="margin:0;">
<a href="https://www.techtimes.com/articles/320736/20260716/rebuilt-gemini-35-pro-misses-third-deadline-google-eyes-stopgap-release.htm?utm_source=aiindustrydaily&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-industry-daily-saturday-july-18-2026" style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#C85520;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:2px;">Tech Times</a>
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 32px 0 32px;border-top:2px solid #1a1714;">
<p style="font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1a1714;margin:0;line-height:1.4;padding:18px 0 16px 0;margin:0;">This week in benchmarks</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 32px 14px 32px;">
<p style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;margin:0;line-height:1.4;margin:0;">vs. Saturday, July 11, 2026</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:14px 32px 14px 32px;">
<p style="font-family:'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#1a1714;margin:0;">
<span style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;margin:0;line-height:1.4;color:#1a1714;margin-right:6px;">Intelligence</span>
<span style="color:#4a4540;">GPT-5.6 Sol (high) fell from #4 to #5</span>
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:14px 32px 14px 32px;border-top:1px solid #ddd6c8;">
<p style="font-family:'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#1a1714;margin:0;">
<span style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;margin:0;line-height:1.4;color:#1a1714;margin-right:6px;">Intelligence</span>
<span style="color:#4a4540;">Claude Opus 4.8 (Adaptive Reasoning, Max Effort) fell from #5 to #6</span>
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:14px 32px 14px 32px;border-top:1px solid #ddd6c8;">
<p style="font-family:'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#1a1714;margin:0;">
<span style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;margin:0;line-height:1.4;color:#1a1714;margin-right:6px;">Intelligence</span>
<span style="color:#4a4540;">GPT-5.6 Terra (max) fell from #6 to #7</span>
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:14px 32px 14px 32px;border-top:1px solid #ddd6c8;">
<p style="font-family:'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#1a1714;margin:0;">
<span style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;margin:0;line-height:1.4;color:#1a1714;margin-right:6px;">Intelligence</span>
<span style="color:#4a4540;">GPT-5.5 (xhigh) fell from #7 to #8</span>
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:14px 32px 14px 32px;border-top:1px solid #ddd6c8;">
<p style="font-family:'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#1a1714;margin:0;">
<span style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;margin:0;line-height:1.4;color:#1a1714;margin-right:6px;">Intelligence</span>
<span style="color:#4a4540;">Grok 4.5 (high) fell from #8 to #9</span>
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:14px 32px 14px 32px;border-top:1px solid #ddd6c8;">
<p style="font-family:'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#1a1714;margin:0;">
<span style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8078;margin:0;line-height:1.4;color:#1a1714;margin-right:6px;">Intelligence</span>
<span style="color:#4a4540;">GPT-5.6 Sol (medium) fell from #9 to #10</span>
</p>
</td></tr>
<!-- Footer -->
<tr><td class="px" style="padding:36px 32px 32px 32px;border-top:2px solid #1a1714;">
<p style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#8a8078;margin:18px 0 6px 0;">
          Read past briefs and the live benchmarks at
          <a href="https://ai-newsletter-eta-lemon.vercel.app?utm_source=aiindustrydaily&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-industry-daily-saturday-july-18-2026" style="color:#4a4540;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#C85520;text-decoration-thickness:1px;">ai-newsletter-eta-lemon.vercel.app</a>.
        </p>
<p style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#8a8078;margin:0;">
          Forward this to a friend who’d appreciate the brief.
        </p>
</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body></p>
<p></p>
    
